{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3d3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b48a-1840-7d93-9d43-f2decee529f8"},"sequence":68,"recorded_at":1780531400000131,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"cc2eb299-8bb3-4a28-9487-6d4564236d15","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"cc2eb299-8bb3-4a28-9487-6d4564236d15","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"cc2eb299-8bb3-4a28-9487-6d4564236d15"},"call_id":"call_01a0b48a3b3d7158adecf353e34ec1c6","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-32ypr2/TASK-260830-32ypr2_rework-rev4.md`.\n1|THIS BRIEF SUPERSEDES EVERY EARLIER PRECONDITION ON TASK-260830-32ypr2, including TASK-260830-32ypr2_rework-rev3.md. Do exactly what is written here.\n2|Rework run for TASK-260830-32ypr2, the FINAL leaf of STORY-260830-1cyj0q. Story_final revision 3 was reviewed by RUN-260918-d009f2 (claude-opus-5 max) and routed CHANGES REQUESTED with NO P1. Read TASK-260830-32ypr2_review-verdict-rev3.md first, and specifically its Section 0: the reviewer states without qualification that the rev2 rework is CLOSED AT THE CLASS, not merely at the witnessed vectors. That was the thing this leaf had failed to do three rounds running, and it is done — the second lenient decoder is gone and the alias axes are pinned. Keep all of it.\n3|What remains is one new P2 outside the previous rework scope, and it is test-plus-matrix only — production is correct and the reviewer probed it. The AC-named invariant \"raw-reference byte ranges resolve to the captured bytes\" is measured by the committed suite only in its DEGENERATE case: every witnessed member is a single record at offset 0. So the natural one-token bug in the offset accumulation survives the whole suite, while matrix row 4 reports the property as driven. That is the same shape this Story has been rejected for repeatedly — a row that claims a property its