\n  \"output\": \"conflicts resolved: 5\\ninternal/axpane 6\\ninternal/terminstance 6\\ninternal/termbind 14\\ninternal/clonebundle 7\\ninternal/clonesnap 7\\ninternal/cloneproject 7\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 153,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 39,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
