n139|\n140|- 1 gofmt check: 0. 2 build: 0. 3 vet: 0.\n141|- 4 `go test ./... -count=1 -v`: 0 — 41 packages `ok`, 2505\n142|  top-level PASS, zero FAIL.\n143|- 5 race gate: 0 in 7 bounded groups (7+6+6+6+6+9+1 = 41\n144|  packages `ok`, zero `DATA RACE`, zero FAIL; `sessquery` alone\n145|  in group G at 335.973s), each with `-timeout 25m`, instead of\n146|  one long call per the headless time bound.\n147|- 6 cover gate: 0 — 41 `ok`; `cloneproject` 90.6% of statements.\n148|- 7–23 fuzz gates (rpcwire ×4, scalar ×1, canonicaljson ×4,\n149|  secconftest ×8, each `-fuzztime=100x -parallel=1`): all 0.\n150|- 24 tracecheck: 0 (ratio above). 25 cataloggen `-adopted … -check`: 0.\n151|- 26 linux build: 0. 27 windows build: 0. 28 JSON parse sweep: 0.\n152|- 29 `task-board validate`: 0 (182 pre-existing board-hygiene\n153|  notes, `MISSING_ACTIVITY` on unrelated elements, none from\n154|  this task).\n155|- 30 `git diff --check`: 0.\n156|- Package evidence on the final tree: `pkg-cloneproject-v.log`\n157|  (95 PASS lines, zero FAIL), `pkg-cloneproject-cover.log`\n158|  (90.6%), `pkg-cloneproject-race.log` (`ok`, zero `DATA RACE`),\n159|  `pkg-siblings.log` (clonebundle + clonesnap `ok`),\n160|  `pkg-traceability.log` (both suites `ok`).\n161|- Config check: `cmp` of `task-board.config.json` against trunk\n162|  bytes is silent (byte-identical); `git status` shows only\n163|  candidate paths (LOGBOOK, README, 2 clonesnap prose files, 6\n164|  traceability files, untracked `internal/cloneproject/`).\n165|\n166|## Bounds (sibling scope, not waived)\n167|\n168|Fixture-native envelope is test-defined framing (body shapes\n169|exact; envelope extras unclaimed and unable to override a claimed\n170|member — strict-map read by exact name, no second decoder, pinned\n171|by the alias-axis test); registries cover exactly the ten emitted\n172|kinds; native-protected records carry no reason code; turns/times\n173|null; call arguments not carried; `partial` / `synthesized` /\n174|`unavailable` and non-text blocks never emitted (shape rules owned\n175|by the accepted clonebundle suite); the §13.14.2 reason vocabulary\n176|is referenced, not owned; §13.14.2–13.14.5 (dispositions, planning,\n177|lineage, bundle chain, transaction, tuple admission) sibling-owned;\n178|§7.8 operation frames stay `sessadapter`; write crash semantics\n179|stay `localstore`; per-edge character-width rows past the envelope\n180|ID edge deferred, now naming `native_type` alongside directives,\n181|call IDs, and tool names (shared `StringLength` gate is landed);\n182|every included non-unknown member parses as the JSONL log (routing\n183|by member class is sibling scope); `directives:null` decodes as\n184|empty; `text:null` seals as empty inline content (`ciphertext:null`\n185|admitted but harmless). Full table with owners in the matrix,\n186|section D. No `ax` command, `doctor` result, or runtime capability\n187|is claimed anywhere.\n188|\n189|## Handoff state\n190|\n191|Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree for the handoff\n192|snapshot. Checklist: all producer items verified true this run\n193|and checked (evidence above + attached). Attached:\n194|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_results.md` (this file),\n195|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_conformance-matrix.md`,\n196|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (real gzip: 30\n197|command logs, 7 race-group logs, package logs, sibling harness\n198|summaries, 2×76 per-plant logs, 2 battery logs, section-run logs,\n199|digest log, cross-check logs, `MANIFEST.sha256`).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
